# KIPPER: with the Upshot Rockets fitted, holding fire readies a rocket and
# letting go sends it straight up; its blast breaks a whole blue block. The
# block stays broken only if the sub then docks.
seed 1
game kipper
wait 5
cheat newgame
cheat clear
cheat calm
cheat fit 4
cheat tile 36 51
wait 2
hold A 30
expect ready == 0
hold A 12
expect ready == 1
wait 2
expect shots_3 == 1
expect ready == 0
wait 30
expect tile_36_49 == 46
expect tile_37_48 == 46
expect tile_35_48 == 46
expect bank_brk == 0
cheat dock 0
expect bank_brk == 6
press A
wait 5
press B
wait 5
expect tile_36_49 == 46
